You have to enjoy the process of pain and 
suffering and solving hard, complex problems.  

56
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:44,719
I'd say with optical devices and optical 
solutions, part of the challenge is that to really  

57
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:52,240
get a full end-to-end electronic and photonic 
solution to work, you're talking about the  

58
00:05:52,240 --> 00:06:00,240
combination of multiple domains of technology and 
expertise. In previous paradigms in the industry,  

59
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:06,639
like in telecommunications, you had specialization 
in those different domains. You'd have entire  

60
00:06:06,639 --> 00:06:14,479
companies that just provided a single laser. 
Or you had entire companies that provided the  

61
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:23,439
DSP engines or parts of the electrical circuits 
that connect to the optical devices. And then  

62
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:30,480
you had entire companies that just built the 
optical devices. I think part of the challenge  

63
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:36,480
is that each of these domains is difficult, and 
you've got to put them all together in a way that  

64
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:45,520
