There's material science involved, device design,  

65
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:55,920
and manufacturing back-end challenges. 
It's layers upon layers of deep, technical,  

66
00:06:57,279 --> 00:07:04,719
difficult problems. Optics layers into anything 
that's difficult in CMOS and high-performance  

67
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:10,080
electronics, and then you layer optics on top of 
that with different supply chains and different  

68
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:20,079
material and device requirements. There are just 
a lot of difficult problems there. So you'll find,  

69
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:24,719
