113
00:12:23,679 --> 00:12:26,399
Mark Wade (12:14.774)
Yeah, and I think we are seeing  

114
00:12:26,399 --> 00:12:34,720
people go through their own educational process, 
trying to understand what the complexities around  

115
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:39,360
