or do you think it might be a big mix  

153
00:17:17,039 --> 00:17:23,279
and match of all these things as guys 
try to figure out their rack designs?

154
00:17:23,279 --> 00:17:26,000
Mark Wade (17:13.334)
I'll tell you how I think about this.  

155
00:17:29,519 --> 00:17:38,400
In the last couple of years, from our largest 
customers and even well-funded startup accelerator  

156
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:50,480
